messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 684357587 and 756476890? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 684357587 and 756476890, we can follow these steps:.\n\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, starting from the rightmost digit (units place).\n2. Add the digits in each column, starting from the units place.\n3. If the sum of any column is greater than 9, carry over the tens digit to the next column.\n4. Continue adding the digits in each column until you reach the leftmost digit (millions place).\n\nLet's perform the addition:.\n\n```.\n  684357587.\n+ 756476890.\n----------.\n```.\n\nStarting from the units place:.\n\n7 + 0 = 7 (no carryover).\n\nNext column:.\n\n8 + 9 = 17 (write down 7 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column:.\n\n5 + 6 + 1 (carryover) = 12 (write down 2 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column:.\n\n7 + 4 + 1 (carryover) = 12 (write down 2 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column:.\n\n3 + 5 + 1 (carryover) = 9 (no carryover).\n\nNext column:.\n\n4 + 6 = 10 (write down 0 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column:.\n\n8 + 7 + 1 (carryover) = 16 (write down 6 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column:.\n\n8 + 5 + 1 (carryover) = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n\nNext column:.\n\n6 + 7 + 1 (carryover) = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1).\n\nFinally, we have the leftmost column:.\n\n6 + 7 + 1 (carryover) = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1). Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
